 Enforcement is at egress and serialization. Secret material is represented inside trusted code as a typed secret reference or secret-store handle whose value cannot be rendered into ordinary JSON payloads. The projection dispatcher, worker submission builder, log/diagnostic writer, export/backup pipeline, and diagnostic-bundle builder share a clearance filter that rejects secret-bearing fields, scans declared payload classes for forbidden secret types, and fails closed when a value is not classified. Diagnostics may record that a credential was missing, revoked, expired, or denied by policy, but not the credential value or enough lookup material to recover it.
 
